    <trans-unit id="metadata.help.multilingual"><source>File metadata can be translated through the normal Filelist translation workflow. For gallery-specific text in another language, edit the translated Mosaic Gallery content element. Without an override, the current fallback behavior applies.</source><target>檔案中繼資料可透過一般檔案清單翻譯工作流程翻譯。若需其他語言的圖片庫專用文字，請編輯已翻譯的 Mosaic Gallery 內容元素。若無覆寫，則套用目前的後援行為。</target></trans-unit>
