    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.guidance"><source>Copies the existing caption lines to the files they currently match and attaches them to those images. The original Quick captions text is retained. After conversion, Image metadata is authoritative and captions remain stable when files are reordered, added, or removed.</source><target>將現有說明文字列複製至目前對應的檔案，並連結至那些圖片。原始快速說明文字會保留。轉換後，圖片中繼資料為準，且重新排序、新增或移除檔案時說明文字仍保持穩定。</target></trans-unit>
